<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">RRK15.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">EZERA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Ezera</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezera</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ezr</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA</para>
  <para style="mt1">EZERA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1" />
  <para style="s1">Omugabe Kuuro okuragiira kwombeka hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1-3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 36:22">2 Bus 36:22</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 36:23">23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gw'okubanza ogw'omu busingye bwa Kuuro omugabe wa Perisi, MUKAMA akakora aha mutima gwa Kuuro ogwo, ngu ekigambo kye ekyagambirwe Yeremia kihikiirire, yaaragiira kuranga ebigambo ebi omu bugabe bwe bwona, kandi n'okubihandiika, naagira ati:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:13">Ezr 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:12">Yer 25:12</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:10">29:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="EZR 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:28">Isa 44:28</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:1">45:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 45:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Kuuro omugabe wa Perisi arikugamba naagira ati: MUKAMA, Ruhanga w'eiguru, ampaire obugabe bwona obw'omu nsi, kandi anyehanangiriize kumwombekyera enju omuri Yerusaalemu ey'omuri Yuda. <verse eid="EZR 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:26">Dan 6:26</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu omuntu weena omuriimwe ow'omu bantu be, Ruhanga we agume nawe, ainamukye Yerusaalemu ey'omuri Yuda, ayombekye enju ya MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, (niwe Ruhanga otuura omuri Yerusaalemu), <verse eid="EZR 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4" />kandi omuntu weena owaahonokireho, ori ei yaashuhuukiire, abantu baayo bamuhwere n'efeeza n'ezaabu, kandi n'ebintu n'amatungo, otabariireho mitoijo ahabw'enju ya Ruhanga ey'omuri Yerusaalemu, ei barikureeta n'omutima gwekundiire.<verse eid="EZR 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 2:13">Fil 2:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahonaaho abakuru b'amaju ga baishenkuru b'Abayuda n'ab'Ababenyamiini baimuka n'abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi, hamwe n'abandi boona, abu Ruhanga yaakozire aha mutima kwinamuka kuza kwombeka enju ya MUKAMA ey'omuri Yerusaalemu; <verse eid="EZR 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:35">Kur 12:35</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 12:36">36</ref>. </char></note> kandi abaabaire batwire nabo baabatwera ebintu by'efeeza, n'ezaabu n'ebindi bintu n'amatungo, n'ebintu by'obuguzi bwingi, otabariireho ebindi byona ebi baatoizire n'omutima gwekundiire. <verse eid="EZR 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:13">2 Bag 24:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:17">2 Bus 36:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 5:14">Ezr 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:5">6:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omugabe Kuuro yaashohoza ebintu by'enju ya MUKAMA, ebi Nebukadeneeza yaabaire anyagire Yerusaalemu, akata omu nju ya baaruhanga be. <verse eid="EZR 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:14">Ezr 5:14</ref>. </char></note> Kuuro omugabe wa Perisi yaaragiira Misiredaasi omubiiki kubiihamu, akabibarira Sheshebazaari omunyiginya wa Yuda. <verse eid="EZR 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9" />Kandi ogu nigwo mubaro gwabyo: eshohaani z'ezaabu makumi ashatu, n'ez'efeeza rukumi, ebyoterero makumi abiri na mwenda, <verse eid="EZR 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10" />enyabya z'ezaabu makumi ashatu, n'ez'efeeza enkumi ibiri na magana ana na ikumi, n'ebindi bintu ebirikukoresibwa rukumi; <verse eid="EZR 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11" />ebintu byona eby'ezaabu n'efeeza bikaba biri enkumi itaano na magana ana na makumi mukaaga na mwenda. Ebyo byona Sheshebazaari akabiinamukana, obu enkwatwa zaihwa Babulooni kugarurwa Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="EZR 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2" />
  <para style="s1">Amaziina g'enkwatwa ezaagarukire owaabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1-70: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 7:6-73">Neh 7:6-73</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aba nibo bantu b'eryo ihanga abaarugire omu bantu abu Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni yaatwaire Babulooni bari enkwatwa, bakagaruka Yerusaalemu na Yuda, buri muntu omu rurembo rw'owaabo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:14-16">2 Bag 24:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:11">25:11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZR 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2" />Bakaija na Zerubabeeli, Yeshua, Nehemia, Seraaya, Relaaya, Morodekai, Bilushaani, Misipaari, Biguvai, Rehumu na Baana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 2:2">Omubaro gw'abashaija b'Abaisraeli nigwo ogu: <verse eid="EZR 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3" />beene Paroshi enkumi ibiri na igana na makumi mushanju na babiri. <verse eid="EZR 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4" />Beene Shefatia, magana ashatu na makumi mushanju na babiri; <verse eid="EZR 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5" />Beene Aara, magana mushanju na makumi mushanju na bataano. <verse eid="EZR 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6" />Beene Pahasimoabu, nibo beene Yeshua na Yoabu, enkumi ibiri na magana munaana na ikumi na babiri. <verse eid="EZR 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7" />Beene Elamu, rukumi na magana abiri na makumi ataano na bana. <verse eid="EZR 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8" />Beene Zaatu, magana mwenda na makumi ana na bataano. <verse eid="EZR 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9" />Beene Zakai, magana mushanju na makumi mukaaga. <verse eid="EZR 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10" />Beene Baani, magana mukaaga na makumi ana na babiri. <verse eid="EZR 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11" />Beene Bebai, magana mukaaga na makumi abiri na bashatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12" />Beene Azigaadi, rukumi na magana abiri na makumi abiri na babiri. <verse eid="EZR 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13" />Beene Adonikaamu, magana mukaaga na makumi mukaaga na mukaaga. <verse eid="EZR 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14" />Beene Biguvai, enkumi ibiri na makumi ataano na mukaaga. <verse eid="EZR 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15" />Beene Adini, magana ana na makumi ataano na bana. <verse eid="EZR 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16" />Beene Ateeri, nibo ba Hezekia, makumi mwenda na munaana. <verse eid="EZR 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17" />Beene Bezai, magana ashatu na makumi abiri na bashatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18" />Beene Yoora, igana na ikumi na babiri. <verse eid="EZR 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19" />Beene Hashumu, magana abiri na bashatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20" />Beene Gibaari makumi mwenda na bataano. <verse eid="EZR 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21" />Beene Betelehemu, igana na makumi abiri na bashatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22" />Abashaija ba Netofa, makumi ataano na mukaaga. <verse eid="EZR 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23" />Abashaija ba Anatoosi, igana na makumi abiri na munaana. <verse eid="EZR 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24" />Beene Azimaveesi, makumi ana na babiri. <verse eid="EZR 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25" />Beene Kiryasarimu, Kefira na Beeroosi, magana mushanju na makumi ana na bashatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26" />Beene Raama na Geeba, magana mukaaga na makumi abiri n'omwe. <verse eid="EZR 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27" />Abashaija ba Mikimaasi, igana na makumi abiri na babiri. <verse eid="EZR 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28" />Abashaija ba Beseeli na Ai, magana abiri na makumi abiri na bashatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29" />Beene Neebo, makumi ataano na babiri. <verse eid="EZR 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30" />Beene Magibishi, igana na makumi ataano na mukaaga. <verse eid="EZR 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:7">Ezr 2:7</ref>. </char></note> Beene Elamu ondiijo, rukumi na magana abiri na makumi ataano na bana. <verse eid="EZR 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32" />Beene Harimu, magana ashatu na makumi abiri. <verse eid="EZR 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33" />Beene Loodi, Hadidi na Ono, magana mushanju na makumi abiri na bataano. <verse eid="EZR 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34" />Beene Yeriko, magana ashatu na makumi ana na bataano. <verse eid="EZR 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35" />Beene Senaha, enkumi ishatu na magana mukaaga na makumi ashatu.<verse eid="EZR 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36" />Abanyamurwa n'aba: beene Yedaaya ab'omu nju ya Yeshua, magana mwenda na makumi mushanju na bashatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37" />Beene Imeri, rukumi na magana ataano na babiri. <verse eid="EZR 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38" />Beene Peshihuuri, rukumi na magana abiri na makumi ana na mushanju. <verse eid="EZR 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39" />Beene Harimu, rukumi na ikumi na mushanju.<verse eid="EZR 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40" />Abaleevi n'aba: beene Yeshua na Kadimieli ab'omuri beene Hodavia, makumi mushanju na bana. <verse eid="EZR 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:39">1 Bus 6:39</ref>. </char></note> Abeeshongozi, beene Asafu igana na makumi abiri na munaana. <verse eid="EZR 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:17">1 Bus 9:17</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 9:18">18</ref>. </char></note> Batabani b'abakumiirizi, beene Shalumu, Ateeri, Talumooni, Akubu, Hatita na Shobai, boona igana na makumi ashatu na mwenda. <verse eid="EZR 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:26">1 Bus 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 11:3">Neh 11:3</ref>. </char></note> Abaheereza b'omuri hekalu bakaba bari aba: beene Ziiha, beene Hasufa, beene Tabaosi, <verse eid="EZR 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44" />beene Kerosi, beene Siaha, beene Padoni, <verse eid="EZR 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45" />beene Lebana, beene Hagaba, beene Akubu, <verse eid="EZR 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46" />beene Hagabu, beene Shamulai, beene Hanani, <verse eid="EZR 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47" />beene Gideli, beene Gahaari, beene Reaya, <verse eid="EZR 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48" />beene Rezini, beene Nekoda, beene Gazamu, <verse eid="EZR 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49" />beene Uzza, beene Pasea, beene Besai, <verse eid="EZR 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50" />beene Asina, beene Meunimu, beene Nefisimu, <verse eid="EZR 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51" />beene Bakibuki, beene Hakufa, beene Harihuri, <verse eid="EZR 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52" />beene Baziluusi, beene Mehida, beene Harisha, <verse eid="EZR 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53" />beene Barikoosi, beene Sisera, beene Teema, <verse eid="EZR 2:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54" />beene Nezia na beene Hatifa. <verse eid="EZR 2:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:55: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:21">1 Bag 9:21</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 11:3">Neh 11:3</ref>. </char></note> Batabani b'abagaragwa ba Sulemaani: beene Sotai, beene Hasoferesi, beene Peruda, <verse eid="EZR 2:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56" />beene Yaala, beene Darikoni, beene Gideli, <verse eid="EZR 2:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57" />beene Shefatia, beene Hatili, beene Pokeresi-hazebaimu na beene Ami.<verse eid="EZR 2:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58" />Abaheereza b'omuri hekalu boona n'abatabani b'abagaragwa ba Sulemaani bakaba bari magana ashatu na makumi mwenda na babiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59" />Kandi aba nibo barugire Telimeela, Teliharasha, Kerubu, Adani na Imeri, kwonka tibaarabaasize kworeka amaju ga baishenkurubo, nari obukomooko bwabo, kuhamya ku bari Abaisraeli buzima; <verse eid="EZR 2:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60" />beene Delaaya, beene Tobia, na beene Nakoda, magana mukaaga na makumi ataano na babiri. <verse eid="EZR 2:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:61: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:27">2 Sam 17:27</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ab'omuri batabani b'abanyamurwa, beene Habaaya, beene Hakozi, na beene Baruzilai, owaashweire omukazi ow'omuri bahara ba Baruzilai owa Gileadi, akeetererwa eiziina ryabo. <verse eid="EZR 2:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:62: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:10">Kub 3:10</ref>. </char></note> Abo bakasherura amaziina gaabo omu baahandiikirwe nk'okukuratana kw'oruzaaro rwa baishenkurubo oku kwabaire kuri, kwonka tigaareebekamu; nikyo baateekateekyeirwe kuba abatashemeire, bakazibirwa kukora omurimo gw'obunyamurwa; <verse eid="EZR 2:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:63: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:30">Kur 28:30</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 22:2">Lev 22:2</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 22:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 8:9">Neh 8:9</ref>. </char></note> omutegyeki omukuru yaabaragiira ngu barekye kurya aha by'okurya ebirikwera, okuhitsya obu haribaho omunyamurwa oine Urimu na Tumimu.<verse eid="EZR 2:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64" />Omutwe gw'abo bantu boona gukaba guri obukumi buna n'enkumi ibiri na magana ashatu na makumi mukaaga, <verse eid="EZR 2:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65" />otabariiremu bahuuku baabo n'abazaana baabo, abu omubaro gwabo gwabaire guri enkumi mushanju na magana ashatu na makumi ashatu na mushanju; kandi bakaba baine abeeshongozi, abashaija n'abakazi, magana abiri. <verse eid="EZR 2:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66" />Embaraasi zaabo zikaba ziri magana mushanju na makumi ashatu na mukaaga, enyumbu magana abiri na makumi ana na itaano, <verse eid="EZR 2:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67" />engamira magana ana na makumi ashatu na itaano, n'endogoya enkumi mukaaga na magana mushanju na makumi abiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68" />Kandi bamwe ab'omu bakuru b'amaju ga baishenkurubo, ku baahikire aha nju ya MUKAMA ey'omuri Yerusaalemu baahonga empongano n'omutima gwekundiire ahabw'okwombeka enju ya Ruhanga omu kibanja kyayo; <verse eid="EZR 2:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69" />baahayo ebiconco nk'oku barikubaasa, nibabita omu ibiikiro ry'empiiha z'omurimo, dariki z'ezaabu obukumi mukaaga na rukumi, na miina z'efeeza enkumi itaano, n'ebijwaro by'abanyamurwa igana.<verse eid="EZR 2:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70" />Kandi abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi na bamwe omu bantu, n'abeeshongozi n'abakumiirizi kandi n'abaheereza b'omuri hekalu batuura omu ndembo zaabo, n'Abaisraeli boona baatuura omu zaabo.<verse eid="EZR 2:70" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3" />
  <para style="s1">Okwombeka eitambiro rya Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 7:73">Neh 7:73</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 8:1">8:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwezi kwa mushanju ku kwabonekire, Abaisraeli bari omu ndembo zaabo, abantu baayeteeranira Yerusaalemu nk'omuntu omwe. <verse eid="EZR 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 3:17-19">1 Bus 3:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:5">Bir 12:5</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 33:1">33:1</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 12:1">Neh 12:1</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 12:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 1:1">Hag 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:12">Mat 1:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:27">Luk 3:27</ref>. </char></note> Ku baahikireyo, Yeshua mwene Yozadaaki yaimuka na beene ishe abanyamurwa, na Zerubabeeli mwene Shealutieli na beene waabo, baayombeka eitambiro rya Ruhanga wa Israeli kutambiraho ebitambo by'okwotsya, nk'oku kihandiikirwe omu biragiro bya Musa omushaija wa Ruhanga. <verse eid="EZR 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:38">Kur 29:38</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 29:39">39</ref>. </char></note> Baata eryo itambiro omu mwanya gwaryo, ahabw'okuba bakaba baine obwoba ahabw'abantu b'omuri ezo nsi, baaritambiriraho MUKAMA ebitambo by'okwotsya, omu kasheeshe n'omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="EZR 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Lev 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 29:12-38">Kub 29:12-38</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 8:14-17">Neh 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:16">Zek 14:16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baijuka obugyenyi bw'ebiro bikuru obw'Ensiisira, nk'oku kihandiikirwe, baatamba ebitambo bya buri izooba, nk'omubaro gwabyo oku gwabaire guri, nibakuratira ekiragiro kya buri izooba; <verse eid="EZR 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:11-15">Kub 28:11-15</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 29:39">29:39</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima baahayo ebitambo by'okwotsya eby'obutoosha, n'eby'okuboneka kw'ameezi, n'eby'amagyenyi ga MUKAMA goona agaatairweho, hamwe n'empongano z'omuntu weena owaahongyeire MUKAMA n'omutima gwekundiire. <verse eid="EZR 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6" />Aha izooba ry'okubanza ery'okwezi kwa mushanju niho baatandiikire kutambira MUKAMA ebitambo by'okwotsya. Kwonka omusingi gwa hekalu ya MUKAMA gukaba gutakatairweho. <verse eid="EZR 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:6">1 Bag 5:6</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 5:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 2:10">2 Bus 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 2:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 1:3">Ezr 1:3</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 1:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:3">6:3</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo baaha abombeki n'ababaizi empiiha, kandi baaha Abasidoni n'Abatuuro eby'okurya n'eby'okunywa n'amajuta, ngu bareete emiti y'emyerezi, kugiiha Lebanooni bakagireeta aha nyanja, bakagihitsya Yoopa, nk'oku Kuuro omugabe wa Perisi yaabaikiriize.<verse eid="EZR 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okutaho omusingi gwa hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 23:4">1 Bus 23:4</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 23:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 2:2">Ezr 2:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa kabiri baherize kuhika aha nju ya Ruhanga omuri Yerusaalemu, omu kwezi kwa kabiri, nibwo Zerubabeeli mwene Shealutieli na Yeshua mwene Yozadaaki baatandika kwombeka, nibakwatanisa na beene waabo abandi, abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi n'abaarugire omu bukwatwa boona, bakaija Yerusaalemu. Baataho Abaleevi abaine emyaka makumi abiri n'okukiraho okureeberera omurimo gw'enju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZR 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:9">Neh 10:9</ref>. </char></note> Yeshua n'abatabani na beene waabo baimuka na Kadumieli n'abatabani beene Yuda kukoresa abakozi abarikukora enju ya Ruhanga nibakwatanisa na beene Henadaadi na beene waabo Abaleevi.<verse eid="EZR 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 6:31">1 Bus 6:31</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 16:4-6">16:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 25:1">25:1</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 25:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abombeki ku baataireho omusingi gwa hekalu ya MUKAMA, abanyamurwa baija bajwaire ebijwaro byabo baine amakondere, n'Abaleevi beene Asafu baija n'ebitaasa, kuhimbisa MUKAMA, nk'oku Daudi omugabe wa Israeli yaaragiire, <verse eid="EZR 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:34">1 Bus 16:34</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 16:41">41</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 12:24">Neh 12:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Zab 100:5</ref>. </char></note> baayeshongora nibaikirizana, nibahimbisa MUKAMA kandi nibamusiima bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZR 3:11">Ahakuba ni murungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZR 3:11">Kandi embabazi ze n'ez'ebiro byona ahari Israeli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 3:11">Ku baabaire nibahimbisa MUKAMA, abantu boona baateera akaari n'amaraka mahango, ahabw'okuheza kutaho omusingi gw'enju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZR 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:3">Hag 2:3</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka baingi omu banyamurwa n'Abaleevi n'abakuru b'amaju ga baishenkurubo, abagurusi abaareebire enju y'okubanza, ku baareebire omusingi gw'enju gwaheza kuteebwaho, baarira nibaborooga munonga, n'obu abandi baraabe baabaire nibateera akaari ahabw'okushemererwa; <verse eid="EZR 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13" />kyareetera abantu kutabaasa kutaanisa amaraka, yaaba gari ag'okushemererwa nari ag'okucura; ahakuba abantu bakaba nibayomba munonga, n'orwari rwabo niruhuririrwa hare.<verse eid="EZR 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4" />
  <para style="s1">Abazigu okubazibira kwombeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1" />Bwanyima abazigu b'Abayuda n'Ababenyamiini ku baahuriire ngu abaarugire omu bukwatwa nibombekyera MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, hekalu, <verse eid="EZR 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:24">2 Bag 17:24</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 17:32">32</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 17:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:37">19:37</ref>. </char></note> baija ahari Zerubabeeli n'abakuru b'amaju ga baishenkurubo, baabagira bati: Ka twombekye hamwe naimwe; ahakuba naitwe turamya Ruhanga waanyu, nk'oku mumuramya, kandi tutuura nitumutambira ebitambo, okuruga omu busingye bwa Esari-hadoni, omugabe wa Asiria owaatureetsire aha. <verse eid="EZR 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:1-3">Ezr 1:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 2:20">Neh 2:20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:9">Yoh 4:9</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Zerubabeeli na Yeshua n'abandi bakuru b'amaju ga baishenkuru b'Abaisraeli baabagarukamu bati: Timwine kakwate naitwe kwombekyera Ruhanga waitu enju; kureka itwe twenka nitwija kwombekyera MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, nk'oku Nyakusinga Kuuro omugabe wa Perisi yaaturagiire.<verse eid="EZR 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4" />Bwanyima abantu b'omuri egyo nsi baateera Abayuda aha mutwe, baabatiinisa kwombeka, <verse eid="EZR 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5" />baaguriirira abahi b'obwengye kubazibira kuhikiiriza eki barikwenda kukora; byaguma bityo omu busingye bwa Kuuro omugabe wa Perisi bwona okuhitsya omu busingye bwa Dario omugabe wa Perisi.<verse eid="EZR 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EST 1:1">Est 1:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omu busingye bwa Ahasuero, ku yaabaire naakitandika, baahandiika ebaruha nibarega abatuuzi ba Yuda na Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="EZR 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:26">2 Bag 18:26</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omu busingye bwa Aruta-gizakiseesi, Bishulaamu, Mesiredaasi, abeeli na bagyenzi baabo abandi baahandiikira Aruta-gizakiseesi omugabe wa Perisi; egyo baruha baagihandiika omu rurimi rwa Siria, kandi baagihindura. <verse eid="EZR 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8" />Rehumu omutegyeki na Shimushai omuhandiiki nabo baahandiikira Aruta-gizakiseesi ebaruha nibarega Yerusaalemu ni bagira bati:<verse eid="EZR 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 17:24">2 Bag 17:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 5:6">Ezr 5:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:6">6:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebaruha ya Rehumu omutegyeki na Shimushai omuhandiiki na bagyenzi baabo abandi, n'abaramuzi, n'abategyeki, n'abatware, n'Abaperisi, n'aba Suusa nibo Baelami, <verse eid="EZR 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:2">Ezr 4:2</ref>. </char></note> n'ab'amahanga agandi abu Osinapaari omutegyeki omukuru rugambwa yaihire owaabo, akabata omu ndembo za Samaria, n'omu byaro ebindi ebiri omu nsi seeri y'Omugyera n'ebindi: <verse eid="EZR 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11" />(ebi nibyo bigambo by'ebaruha ei baatwekire;) Nyakusinga Omugabe Aruta-gizakiseesi, itwe abairu baawe ab'omu nsi ya seeri y'Omugyera nitukuramutsya. <verse eid="EZR 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:3">Ezr 5:3</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 5:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu Nyakusinga omugabe, omanye Abayuda, abaarugire okwo, bakaija kunu Yerusaalemu, orurembo orugomi kandi orubi; mbwenu nibarwombeka, kandi baaherize engo z'amabaare n'omusingi. <verse eid="EZR 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:24">Ezr 7:24</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu Nyakusinga, omanye ngu, ku baraayombekye oru rurembo, baaheza n'engo zaarwo, tibarikutoijera, n'obu kwakuba okuha omushoro n'ehoozi; ekirirugamu empiiha z'obugabe ziryatuuba. <verse eid="EZR 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14" />Mbwenu ahabw'okuba tutungirwe obugabe, kandi n'ahabw'okutenda kureeba omugabe naihwaho ekitiinisa, nikyo twakutumiraho kukumanyisa, <verse eid="EZR 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15" />ngu basherure omu kitabo ekirikwijutsya ebyabaireho omu busingye bwa baashwenkuru. Ebyo noija kubishanga omuri ekyo kitabo, omanye ku orurembo oru ruba orugomi, orunyangaraza abagabe n'ensi zaabo, kandi okuruga ira ku rushangwa rugomesa abantu. Ekyo nikyo kyarureeteire kucwekyerezibwa. <verse eid="EZR 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16" />Nitumanyisa omugabe ngu, oru rurembo ku ruraayombekwe, engo zaarwo zaahwa, noija kubura eki waatunga omu nsi egi eya seeri y'Omugyera.<verse eid="EZR 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugabe okuragiira kuba barekire kwombeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17" />Omugabe yaatuma ahari Rehumu omutegyeki na Shimushai omuhandiiki na bagyenzi baabo abandi abaabaire batwire Samaria n'omu bindi byanga by'ensi eya seeri y'Omugyera, yaabagarukamu naagira ati: Muri buhooro, n'ebindi? <verse eid="EZR 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18" />Ebaruha ei mwatutwekyeire, bagishomeire omu maisho gaitu, yaashobooroka. <verse eid="EZR 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19" />Naaragiira ku basherura, baashanga ngu okuruga ira orwo rurembo rukaba rwimukirira abagabe, kandi eby'obugomi n'okwebumba bikaba biruhanuurirwamu. <verse eid="EZR 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:24">Ezr 7:24</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 4:21">1 Bag 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 72:8">Zab 72:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ngu rukaba rubamu abagabe b'amaani abaabaire bategyeka Yerusaalemu n'ebyanga byona ebya seeri y'Omugyera, kandi bakaba baheebwa emitoijo n'omushoro n'empooza. <verse eid="EZR 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21" />N'ahabw'ekyo muteho ekiragiro abo bashaija barekyere aho, orwo rurembo rurekye kwombekwa, okuhitsya obu ndibaragiira ekindi. <verse eid="EZR 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22" />Kandi mwerinde, muteeganda ahari ekyo, akabi katakaakura, kakareetera abagabe kufeerwa.<verse eid="EZR 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23" />Bwanyima ku baaherize kushomera ebaruha y'omugabe Aruta-gizakiseesi omu maisho ga Rehumu na Shimushai omuhandiiki na bagyenzi baabo, ahonaaho baimuka, baaza Yerusaalemu ahu Abayuda baabaire bari, baabazibira kukora n'amaani n'obushoboorozi. <verse eid="EZR 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24" />N'ahabw'ekyo omurimo gw'enju ya Ruhanga ey'omuri Yerusaalemu baagurekyera aho, okuhitsya omu busingye bwa Dario omugabe wa Perisi.<verse eid="EZR 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5" />
  <para style="s1">Baanabi okwezirikisa abantu kugaruka kwombeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAG 1:1">Hag 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 1:1">Zek 1:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima baanabi Hagai na Zekaria mwene Ido baahanuurira Abayudaaya abaabaire bari Yuda na Yerusaalemu omu iziina rya Ruhanga wa Israeli. <verse eid="EZR 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:2">Ezr 3:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:14">6:14</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho Zerubabeeli mwene Shealutieli na Yeshua mwene Yozadaaki baimuka, baatandika kugaruka kwombeka enju ya Ruhanga ey'omuri Yerusaalemu, nibahwerwa baanabi ba Ruhanga abo, abaabaire bari hamwe nabo. <verse eid="EZR 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:12">Ezr 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:6">6:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 6:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro ebyo Tatenai omutegyeki w'ensi egyo eya seeri y'Omugyera na Shesari-bozenai na bagyenzi baabo baabashanga ahu baabaire bari, baababuuza bati: N'oha obaragiire kwombeka enju egi n'okuheza oru rugo rw'amabaare? <verse eid="EZR 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4" />Baagaruka baababuuza bati: Abarikwombeka egi nju amaziina gaabo nibaahi? <verse eid="EZR 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 33:18">Zab 33:18</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka eriisho rya Ruhanga waabo ryaguma aha bategyeki b'Abayudaaya, tibaabazibira kwombeka, batakamanyiise Dario, nawe akabagarukamu aha kigambo ekyo.<verse eid="EZR 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 4:9">Ezr 4:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebigambo by'ebaruha ei Tatenai omutegyeki w'ensi egyo eya seeri y'Omugyera na Shesari-bozenai na bagyenzi be abamashaza b'omuri egyo nsi, ebi baatwekyeire omugabe Dario nibyo ebi: <verse eid="EZR 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7" />Nyakusinga Dario omugabe, nitukwendeza obusingye bwonka! <verse eid="EZR 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8" />Nitukumanyisa ku tugiire omu ishaza rya Yuda, aha nju ya Ruhanga Nyamuhanga, erikwombekyesibwa amabaare mahango, bakatambika emitambiko mihango omu bisiika byayo; omurimo ogwo nibagukora n'obweziriki, kandi nigugyenda gye. <verse eid="EZR 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:12">Ezr 4:12</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu tubuurize abo bakuru, nitubagira tuti: N'oha obaragiire kwombeka enju egi, n'okuheza oru rugo rw'amabaare? <verse eid="EZR 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10" />Kandi twababuuza n'amaziina gaabo, ngu tubone kugakumanyisa, kandi n'okukuhandiikira amaziina g'abarikubategyeka. <verse eid="EZR 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1">1 Bag 6:1</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:38">38</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo baatugarukiremu, nibagira bati: Turi abairu ba Ruhanga w'eiguru n'ensi, kandi hati nitugaruka kwombeka enju eyaayombekirwe ira emyaka mingi ehingwire, ei omugabe wa Israeli rugambwa yaayombekire akaheza. <verse eid="EZR 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:8-11">2 Bag 25:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Bus 36:16</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 36:17">17</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Ruhanga w'eiguru, ahabw'okugwisibwa kubi baatatenkuriitwe, akabahayo omu mikono ya Nebukadeneeza Omukaludaaya omugabe wa Babulooni, yaasheenya egyo nju, yaatwara abantu Babulooni bari enkwata. <verse eid="EZR 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:1">Ezr 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Kuuro omugabe wa Babulooni, omu mwaka gw'okubanza ogw'omu busingye bwe, akaragiira ku egi nju ya Ruhanga eshemereire kwombekwa. <verse eid="EZR 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:7">Ezr 1:7</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 1:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:5">6:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ebintu by'omu nju ya Ruhanga eby'ezaabu n'eby'efeeza, ebi Nebukadeneeza yaanyagire omuri hekalu ya Yerusaalemu, akabitwara omuri hekalu ya Babulooni, omugabe Kuuro yaabiiha omuri egyo hekalu ya Babulooni, baabiha omuntu orikwetwa Sheshebazaari, ou yaahindwire omutegyeki; <verse eid="EZR 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15" />yaamuragiira ati: Twara ebintu ebi, ogyende, obite omuri hekalu y'omuri Yerusaalemu, enju ya Ruhanga egarukye eyombekwe omu kibanja kyayo. <verse eid="EZR 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:8">Ezr 3:8</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 3:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 5:2">5:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:15">6:15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:9">Zek 4:9</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Sheshebazaari ogwo yaija, yaataho emisingi y'enju ya Ruhanga omuri Yerusaalemu; mbwenu okwiha obwo n'okuhitsya hati neekyombekwa, tekahweire. <verse eid="EZR 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17" />N'ahabw'ekyo, omugabe ku araakisiime, basherure omu nju y'eibiikiro ry'omugabe wa Babulooni, bareebe Kuuro ku araabe atararagiire kwombeka egi nju ya Ruhanga omuri Yerusaalemu. Haza obwo omugabe atutumeho eki arikusiima omu kigambo eki.<verse eid="EZR 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6" />
  <para style="s1">Dario okuhamya ekiragiro kya Kuuro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1" />Bwanyima Dario omugabe yaaragiira kusherura omu nju y'ebitabo by'ebyabaireho omuri Babulooni, omu baabaire babiika ebintu by'obuguzi bwingi. <verse eid="EZR 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:6">2 Bag 17:6</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima baasherura omuri Akimeta, ekikaari ky'obugabe eky'omu ishaza rya Media, baazooramu omuzingo gw'ekitabo ogwahandiikirwemu ebigambo ebirikugira biti: <verse eid="EZR 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:2">Ezr 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 6:2">1 Bag 6:2</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe Kuuro, omu mwaka gw'okubanza ogw'omu busingye bwe, akataho ekiragiro eki: Ebirikukwata aha nju ya Ruhanga ey'omuri Yerusaalemu, enju egyo eyombekwe, ebe omwanya ogw'okutambiramu ebitambo, emisingi yaayo eteebweho gye, ehame; obwemi bwayo bube mikono makumi mukaaga, n'obukiika bwayo mikono makumi mukaaga; <verse eid="EZR 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:36">1 Bag 6:36</ref>. </char></note> egire emishorongo eshatu y'amabaare mahango n'omushorongo gumwe gw'emitambiko y'ebiti; eby'okugiihurira birugye omu ibiikiro ry'empiiha z'obugabe. <verse eid="EZR 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:7">Ezr 1:7</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 1:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 5:14">5:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ebintu by'enju ya Ruhanga, eby'ezaabu n'eby'efeeza, ebi Nebukadeneeza yaanyagire omuri hekalu ey'omuri Yerusaalemu, akabitwara Babulooni, babigarureyo, babite omuri hekalu egyo, buri kintu kigarukye omu mwanya gwakyo; mubite omu nju ya Ruhanga.<verse eid="EZR 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 5:3">Ezr 5:3</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 5:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu iwe Tatenai omutegyeki w'ensi ya seeri y'Omugyera, na Shesari-bozenai, na bagyenzi baanyu abamashaza ab'ebyanga bya seeri y'Omugyera, mugume hangahari, <verse eid="EZR 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7" />mutagira eki mwakora ekirikuzibira omurimo gw'egyo nju ya Ruhanga; omutegyeki w'Abayuda n'abakuru baabo babe nibo baayombeka egyo nju ya Ruhanga omu kibanja kyayo. <verse eid="EZR 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8" />Kandi naataho ekiragiro ky'ebi mushemereire kukorera abo bakuru b'Abayudaaya ahabw'okwombeka enju ya Ruhanga; mwihe aha mpiiha z'obugabe ezirugire omu mushoro gw'abantu b'ensi ya seeri y'Omugyera, muteho omutima kuha abo bashaija eby'okwihurira omurimo, barekye kugira ekyabazibira kukora. <verse eid="EZR 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9" />Kandi eki bariba nibeetenga kyona, yaaba nimi z'ebimasha, empaya z'entaama nari entaama ahabw'ebitambo by'okwotsya kutambira Ruhanga w'eiguru, nari engano, omwonyo, viinyo nari amajuta, ebi abanyamurwa ba Yerusaalemu bariba nibeetenga, bagume babiheebwe buri izooba bitaribura, <verse eid="EZR 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:7">Yer 29:7</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:2">1 Tim 2:2</ref>. </char></note> babone kuguma nibatambira Ruhanga w'eiguru ebitambo by'ekisooroora kirungi, kandi bashabire omugabe n'abatabani okugira amagara. <verse eid="EZR 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:5">Dan 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 3:29">3:29</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nintaho ekiragiro nti: Omuntu weena orihindura ekigambo ekyo, baryahigura enyomyo omu nju ye, bagimuhanikyeho, n'enju ye bagihindure orubungo. <verse eid="EZR 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:3">1 Bag 9:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Ruhanga, owaagumizeyo eiziina rye, acwekyereze omugabe weena, nari abantu, abariimutsya emikono yaabo kuhindura ekiragiro eki, nari okusheenya egyo nju ya Ruhanga ey'omuri Yerusaalemu. Nyowe Dario, niinye naaragiira ekyo kiragiro; kihikiirizibwe n'obweziriki bwona.<verse eid="EZR 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayuda okuheza hekalu n'okugitaaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13" />Bwanyima Tatenai omutegyeki w'ensi eya seeri y'Omugyera, na Shesari-bozenai na bagyenzi baabo baayezirika munonga kukora eki Dario omugabe yaaragiire, nk'ekigambo eki yaabatumireho oku kyabaire kiri. <verse eid="EZR 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:1">Ezr 5:1</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 5:2">2</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 5:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 7:21">7:21</ref>. </char></note> Abakuru b'Abayudaaya baayombeka, byagyenda gye ahabw'okuhanuura kwa nabi Hagai na Zekaria mwene Ido. Baayombeka, baaheza ahabw'okuragiirwa Ruhanga wa Israeli, kandi n'ahabw'ekiragiro ekyatairweho Kuuro na Dario na Aruta-gizakiseesi omugabe wa Perisi; <verse eid="EZR 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:7">Est 3:7</ref>. </char></note> egyo nju yaahwa aha kiro kya kashatu ky'okwezi kwa Adari, omu mwaka gwa mukaaga ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Dario.<verse eid="EZR 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:63">1 Bag 8:63</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Abaisraeli, abanyamurwa, Abaleevi n'abandi abaarugire omu bukwatwa, baagira obugyenyi bw'okushoroora egyo nju ya Ruhanga baine okushemererwa. <verse eid="EZR 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:35">Ezr 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:31">1 Bag 18:31</ref>. </char></note> Ku baabaire nibagishoroora, baahonga enimi igana, empaya z'entaama magana abiri, n'abaana b'entaama magana aha; kandi baatamba empaya z'embuzi ikumi na ibiri kuba empongano z'okurihiirira ekibi ahabw'Abaisraeli boona, nk'omubaro gw'enganda zaabo oku gwabaire guri. <verse eid="EZR 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:6">Kub 3:6</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 23:6">1 Bus 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 24:1">24:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 35:5">2 Bus 35:5</ref>. </char></note> Baata abanyamurwa omu mbu zaabo, nk'oku baabaire nibakuratana, n'Abaleevi baaza omu myanya yaabo, kuheereza Ruhanga omuri Yerusaalemu, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe omu kitabo kya Musa.<verse eid="EZR 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:6">Kur 12:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima abaarugire omu bukwatwa baijuka obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho aha kiro kya ikumi na bina ky'okwezi kw'okubanza. <verse eid="EZR 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:15">2 Bus 30:15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 35:11">35:11</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi bakaba beeyereize hamwe; boona bashemeire. N'ahabw'ekyo baita omwana gw'entaama gw'Okuhingurwaho ahabw'abaarugire omu bukwatwa boona, n'ahabwa beene waabo abanyamurwa, n'ahabwabo bonka. <verse eid="EZR 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:1">Ezr 9:1</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:2">Neh 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 10:28">10:28</ref>. </char></note> Gwariibwa Abaisraeli abaarugire omu bukwatwa, n'abantu boona abaabaire beetaaniise n'ebihagaro by'abanyamahanga ab'omu nsi egyo, bakakwatanisa n'Abaisraeli kuramya MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli. <verse eid="EZR 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:27">Ezr 7:27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 30:21">2 Bus 30:21</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 35:17">35:17</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:15">Kur 12:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:6">13:6</ref>. </char></note> Baijuka obugyenyi bw'emigaati etatumbisiibwe, baamara ebiro mushanju nibashemererwa; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akabaha okushemererwa, kandi yaahindura omutima gw'omugabe wa Asiria, yaabakunda, yaabahwera omu murimo gw'okwombeka enju ya Ruhanga, Ruhanga wa Israeli.<verse eid="EZR 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7" />
  <para style="s1">Omugabe okwikiriza Ezera kuza Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1-5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 6:4-14">1 Bus 6:4-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo omu busingye gwa Aruta-gizakiseesi, omugabe wa Perisi, hakaba hariho omushaija orikwetwa Ezera mwene Seraaya, mwijukuru wa Azaria, Azaria ya Hilukia, <verse eid="EZR 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2" />Hilukia ya Shalumu, Shalumu ya Zadoki, Zadoki ya Ahitubu, <verse eid="EZR 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3" />Ahitubu ya Amaria, Amaria ya Azaria, Azaria ya Merayoosi, <verse eid="EZR 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4" />Merayoosi ya Zerahia, Zerahia ya Uuzi, Uuzi ya Buuki, <verse eid="EZR 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5" />Buuki ya Abishua, Abishua ya Finehaasi, Finehaasi ya Eleazaari, mwene Arooni omunyamurwa omukuru; <verse eid="EZR 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:31">Ezr 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 2:8">Neh 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 8:1">8:1</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 12:26">12:26</ref>. </char></note> Ezera ogwo akaruga Babulooni, yainamuka kuza Yerusaalemu; kandi akaba ari omuhandiiki w'obwengye omu by'ebiragiro bya Musa, ebyahairwe MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli. Omugabe yaamuha ebi yaashabire byona, ahabw'okuba omukono gwa MUKAMA Ruhanga we gukaba gumuriho.<verse eid="EZR 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 2:43">Ezr 2:43</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 8:1-20">8:1-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi n'abandi omu Baisraeli bainamuka hamwe nawe n'abamwe aha banyamurwa, Abaleevi, abeeshongozi, abakumiirizi n'abaheereza b'omuri hekalu, baaza Yerusaalemu omu mwaka gwa mushanju ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Aruta-gizakiseesi. <verse eid="EZR 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8" />Ezera yaahika Yerusaalemu omu kwezi kwa kataano omu mwaka gwa mushanju ogw'omu busingye bw'ogwo mugabe; <verse eid="EZR 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9" />ahakuba aha kiro ky'okubanza eky'okwezi kw'okubanza akatandika kuruga Babulooni, kandi aha kiro ky'okubanza omu kwezi kwa kataano yaahika Yerusaalemu, ahabw'okuba omukono gwa Ruhanga we omurungi gukaba gumuriho. <verse eid="EZR 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:25">Ezr 7:25</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 8:1-8">Neh 8:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 2:7">Mal 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:2">Mat 23:2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 23:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Ezera ogwo akaba ataire omutima gwe aha kwega ebiragiro bya MUKAMA, n'okubyorobera, kandi n'okwegyesa Abaisraeli ebyo biragiro n'emigyenzo eyaatairweho.<verse eid="EZR 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:11-26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 2:37">Dan 2:37</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:16">Kush 19:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Egi niyo baruha ei omugabe Aruta-gizakiseesi yaahaire Ezera omunyamurwa, kandi omuhandiiki, owaabaire ari omunyabwengye omu by'ebiragiro bya MUKAMA n'ebi yaataireho ahabwa Israeli.<verse eid="EZR 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebaruha ei omugabe yaahaire Ezera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12" />Nyowe Aruta-gizakiseesi, omugabe w'abagabe, naakuhandiikira, Ezera omunyamurwa, kandi omuhandiiki w'ebiragiro bya Ruhanga w'eiguru, ninkuramutsya munonga, n'ebindi! <verse eid="EZR 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13" />Mbwenu nintaho ekiragiro nti: Omuntu weena omu Baisraeli, nari omu banyamurwa baabo nari ow'omu Baleevi, abari omu bugabe bwangye, orikwenda kuza Yerusaalemu atagyemirwe, agyende naiwe. <verse eid="EZR 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14" />Ahabw'okuba nyowe omugabe n'abahi b'obwengye bangye mushanju twakutuma ngu oze kubuuza ebya Yuda na Yerusaalemu, nk'ebiragiro bya Ruhanga waawe ebi oine oku biri, <verse eid="EZR 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:25">Ezr 8:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:21">Zab 135:21</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 6:2">2 Bus 6:2</ref>. </char></note> kandi otware efeeza n'ezaabu, ebi nyowe omugabe n'abahi b'obwengye bangye tutoijeire Ruhanga, otuura Yerusaalemu, ahabwaitu, <verse eid="EZR 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:6">1 Bus 29:6</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 29:9">9</ref>. </char></note> hamwe n'efeeza yoona n'ezaabu ezi orishanga omu ishaza rya Babulooni ryona, hamwe n'emitoijo y'abantu n'abanyamurwa, ei baaraganiise kutoija n'omutima gwekundiire ahabw'enju ya Ruhanga waabo eri omuri Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:2-13">Kub 15:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:5">Bir 12:5</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:11">11</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo oyezirikye munonga kugura n'empiiha ezo enimi empaya z'entaama n'abaana b'entaama hamwe n'empongano z'esaano, n'ez'eby'okunywa eby'okuhongwa nazo, mubitambire aha itambiro ry'enju ya Ruhanga waanyu omuri Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18" />Kandi ebirishaaga ahari ezo feeza n'ezaabu, iwe na beene waanyu, oku muryenda kubitwaza, mubitwaze kwo, nimukuratira ebi Ruhanga waanyu arikusiima. <verse eid="EZR 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19" />Kandi n'ebintu ebi ohairwe kukoresa omu nju ya Ruhanga waawe oryabimurikira omu maisho ga Ruhanga wa Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20" />Kandi ekindi kyona ekiriba nikyetengwa ahabw'enju ya Ruhanga waawe, eki oryenda kuha, okiihe omu ibiikiro ry'omugabe, okihe. <verse eid="EZR 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:6">Ezr 7:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nyowe, omugabe Aruta-gizakiseesi, naaragiira ababiiki b'omu nsi eya seeri y'Omugyera boona nti: Kyona eki Ezera omunyamurwa, kandi omuhandiiki w'ebiragiro bya Ruhanga w'eiguru, aribashaba, mukikore n'obweziriki bwona, <verse eid="EZR 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22" />okutarenzya aha talanta z'efeeza igana, encuro z'engano igana, enjoga za viinyo igana, entsimbo z'amajuta igana, n'omwonyo ogurengire ekigyero. <verse eid="EZR 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23" />Ekiriragiirwa Ruhanga w'eiguru kyona, kikorerwe kimwe ahabw'enju ye, ekiniga kye kitakaija aha mugabe n'abatabani. <verse eid="EZR 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:13">Ezr 4:13</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 4:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nitubamanyisa eby'abanyamurwa, Abaleevi, abeeshongozi, abakumiirizi, abaheereza b'omuri hekalu n'abandi bakozi b'omuri egyo nju ya Ruhanga boona oku baingana, ku mutarikwikirizibwa kubatoijesa emitoijo, nari okubashoza omushoro, n'obu kwakuba okubahooza ehoozi.<verse eid="EZR 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 7:10">Ezr 7:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:18">Bir 16:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 18:21">Kur 18:21</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 18:22">22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi naiwe Ezera, nk'obwengye bwa Ruhanga waawe obu oine oku buri, oryataho abategyeki n'abaramuzi b'okucwa emanja z'abantu b'omu nsi ya seeri y'Omugyera, abarikumanya ebiragiro bya Ruhanga waawe boona; n'abatarikubimanya, muryaguma mubibeegyese. <verse eid="EZR 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26" />Kandi weena otariikiriza kworobera biragiro bya Ruhanga waawe n'eby'omugabe, aheebwe ekifubiro, atarikusaasirwa, eky'okwitwa, nari okubingwa, nari okunyagwa ebintu bye, nari okuteebwa omu kihome. <verse eid="EZR 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:22">Ezr 6:22</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:10">1 Bus 29:10</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Ezera yaagira ati: MUKAMA asiimwe, Ruhanga wa baatatenkuriitwe, ahabw'okuta ekintu nk'eki omu mutima gw'omugabe, okushemeza enju ya MUKAMA ey'omuri Yerusaalemu, <verse eid="EZR 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:9">Ezr 9:9</ref>. </char></note> kandi n'ahabw'okumpa okugirirwa embabazi omu maisho g'omugabe n'abahi b'obwengye be, n'omu maisho g'abategyeki be boona ab'obushoboorozi. Nikyo naahamiire ahabw'omukono gwa MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye ogwabaire gundiho, nkateerana abakuru bamwe omuri Israeli ngu twinamukane.<verse eid="EZR 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8" />
  <para style="s1">Abaarugire Babulooni na Ezera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1" />Aba nibo bakuru b'amaju ga baishenkurubo, kandi oku nikwo kukuratana kw'oruzaaro rw'abaarugire naanye Babulooni omu busingye bw'omugabe Aruta-gizakiseesi. <verse eid="EZR 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 3:22">1 Bus 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 24:1">24:1</ref>. </char></note> Omuri beene Finehaasi, Gereshoni; omuri beene Itamaari Danieli; omuri beene Daudi Hatushi; <verse eid="EZR 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3-14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:3-15">Ezr 2:3-15</ref>. </char></note> omuri beene Shekania. Omuri beene Paroshi Zakaria owaahandiikirwe hamwe n'abashaija igana na makumi ataano. <verse eid="EZR 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4" />Omuri beene Pahasi-moabu Eliehoenai mwene Zerahia, kandi ogwo akaba ari hamwe n'abashaija magana abiri. <verse eid="EZR 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5" />Omuri beene Zatu Shekania mwene Yahazieli, hamwe n'abashaija magana ashatu. <verse eid="EZR 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6" />Omuri beene Adini Ebedi mwene Yonasaani hamwe n'abashaija makumi ataano. <verse eid="EZR 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7" />Omuri beene Elamu Yeshaya mwene Atalia hamwe n'abashaija makumi mushanju. <verse eid="EZR 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8" />Omuri beene Shefatia Zebadia mwene Mikaeli hamwe n'abashaija makumi munaana. <verse eid="EZR 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9" />Omuri beene Yoabu Obadia mwene Yehieli, hamwe n'abashaija magana abiri na ikumi na munaana. <verse eid="EZR 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10" />Omuri beene Baani Shelomiisi mwene Yosifia hamwe n'abashaija igana na makumi mukaaga. <verse eid="EZR 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11" />Omuri beene Bebai Zekaria mwene Bebai hamwe n'abashaija makumi abiri na munaana. <verse eid="EZR 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12" />Omuri beene Azigaadi Yohanaani mwene Hakataani hamwe n'abashaija igana na ikumi. <verse eid="EZR 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13" />Omuri beene Adonikaamu abaizire bwanyima, amaziina gaabo Elifeleti, Yeueli, na Shemaaya hamwe n'abashaija makumi mukaaga. <verse eid="EZR 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14" />Omuri beene Biguvai Usai na Zakuri hamwe n'abashaija makumi mushanju.<verse eid="EZR 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ezera okweteekateekyera orugyendo n'okurushabira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 7:7">Ezr 7:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abo boona nkabateeranira aha mugyera Ahava, twateeraho ensiisira, twamaraho kashatu. Ku naabaire niinyetegyereza abantu n'abanyamurwa, naashanga hatarimu n'omwe ow'omuri beene Leevi. <verse eid="EZR 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16" />Naatuma kweta Eliezeeri, Arieli, Shemaya, Elinasani, Yaribu, Elinasani, Nasani, Zekaria na Meshulaamu, abashaija bakuru, hamwe na Yoyaribu na Elinasani abaabaire bari abashaija abarikwetegyereza, <verse eid="EZR 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17" />naabatuma ahari Ido, omutegyeki w'ekyaro ekirikwetwa Kasifia, naabagambira ebi baraagambire Ido na beene ishe abaheereza b'omuri hekalu abaabaire bari omuri ekyo kyaro, ngu batwoherereze abaheereza b'okukora omu nju ya Ruhanga waitu. <verse eid="EZR 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:6">Ezr 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 6:18">1 Bus 6:18</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'omukono gwa Ruhanga waitu omurungi ogwabaire guturiho, baatureetera omushaija orikwetegyereza ow'omuri beene Mahili mwene Leevi mwijukuru wa Israeli, orikwetwa Sherebia hamwe n'abatabani na beene waabo, boona ikumi na munaana; <verse eid="EZR 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:1">1 Bus 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 12:24">Neh 12:24</ref>. </char></note> na Hashabia hamwe na Yeshaaya ow'omuri beene Merari, na beene ishe n'abatabani baabo, boona makumi abiri; <verse eid="EZR 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:43">Ezr 2:43</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 7:7">7:7</ref>. </char></note> otabariireho baheereza b'omuri hekalu magana abiri na makumi abiri, abu Daudi n'abatware be baatooraine kuheereza Abaleevi. Abo boona baagambwaho nk'oku amaziina gaabo gaabaire gari.<verse eid="EZR 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 5:8">Zab 5:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naarangira ahari ogwo mugyera Ahava, ku habaho okwesiibyakwo, ngu tubone kwecureeza omu maisho ga Ruhanga waitu, tumuhabuzeho omuhanda gugororokire ahabwaitu, ahabw'abaana baitu abato n'ahabw'ebintu byaitu byona; <verse eid="EZR 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:2">2 Bus 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 2:9">Neh 2:9</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba nkagira enshoni z'okushaba omugabe omutwe gw'engabo z'abaserukare n'ab'aha mbaraasi kuturinda abazigu omu muhanda, ahakuba tukaba twagambiire omugabe tuti: Omukono gwa Ruhanga waitu guri aha barikumusherura boona kubagirira gye; kwonka amaani ge n'ekiniga kye birwanisa abamutsigaho boona. <verse eid="EZR 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23" />Tutyo twayesiibyakwo, twashaba Ruhanga waitu nitumweshengyereza; yaahurira okweshengyereza kwaitu.<verse eid="EZR 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 12:24">Neh 12:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naatoorana abakuru ikumi na babiri omu banyamurwa, Sherebia na Hashabia n'abandi ikumi omuri beene waabo. <verse eid="EZR 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:15">Ezr 7:15</ref>. </char></note> Naabapimira efeeza n'ezaabu n'ebintu, ebyatoizirwe omugabe n'abahi b'obwengye be n'abatware be n'Abaisraeli boona abaabaire bari aho, ahabw'enju ya Ruhanga waitu. <verse eid="EZR 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26" />Ntyo naabakwatsa etalanta z'efeeza magana mukaaga na makumi ataano, n'ebintu by'efeeza eby'etalanta igana n'etalanta z'ezaabu igana, <verse eid="EZR 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27" />n'enyabya z'ezaabu makumi abiri eza dariki rukumi, n'ebintu bibiri by'emiringa mirungi ekuubirwe eby'obuguzi bwingi nk'obw'ezaabu. <verse eid="EZR 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:6">Lev 21:6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 22:2">22:2</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 22:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Naabagira nti: Muri abeereziibwe MUKAMA, kandi ezi feeza n'ezaabu n'emitoijo ei baatoijeire MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baashwenkuriimwe n'omutima gwekundiire. <verse eid="EZR 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29" />Mubibiikye kandi mubirinde, okuhitsya obu muribipimira omu maisho g'abanyamurwa abakuru n'Abaleevi n'abakuru b'amaju ga baishenkuru b'Abaisraeli omu bishengye by'enju ya MUKAMA omuri Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="EZR 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30" />Batyo abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi baayakiira efeeza n'ezaabu n'ebindi bintu, nk'oku oburemeezi bwabyo bwabaire buri, kubitwara Yerusaalemu omu nju ya Ruhanga waitu.<verse eid="EZR 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ezera okuhika Yerusaalemu n'abu yaabaire aine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 7:6">Ezr 7:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 7:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima aha kiro kya ikumi na bibiri ky'okwezi kw'okubanza twaruga aha mugyera Ahava kuza Yerusaalemu; omukono gwa Ruhanga waitu gwatugumaho, yaatujuna omu mikono y'abazigu baitu, n'abaabaire batugwereire omu muhanda. <verse eid="EZR 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:11">Neh 2:11</ref>. </char></note> Ku twahikire Yerusaalemu, twahamara ebiro bishatu; <verse eid="EZR 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 11:16">Neh 11:16</ref>. </char></note> aha izooba rya kana twapimira efeeza n'ezaabu n'ebindi bintu omu nju ya Ruhanga waitu, twabikwatsa Meremoosi omunyamurwa mwene Uriya, owaabaire ari hamwe na Eleazaari mwene Finehaasi, bakwataniise n'Abaleevi Yozabaadi mene Yeshua na Noadia mwene Binui. <verse eid="EZR 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34" />Byona byabarwa, byapimwa, kandi oburemeezi bwa buri kintu bwahandiikwa.<verse eid="EZR 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 2:1">Ezr 2:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:17">6:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima abaagarukire nibaruga omu bukwatwa baatambira Ruhanga wa Israeli ebitambo by'okwotsya, enimi ikumi na ibiri ahabwa Israeli yoona, empaya z'entaama makumi mwenda na mukaaga, abaana b'entaama makumi mushanju na mushanju, kandi baahonga empaya z'embuzi ikumi na ibiri kuba ekitambo ky'okurihiirira ekibi. Ebyo byona byaba ekitambo ky'okwokyeza MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZR 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:21">Ezr 7:21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baaha abategyeki b'omugabe n'abamashaza b'ensi ya seeri y'Omugyera ebiragiro by'omugabe; nabo baahwera abantu n'enju ya Ruhanga.<verse eid="EZR 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ezera okusaasibwa ebibi by'abantu n'okubyaturira Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 6:21">Ezr 6:21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:30">Bir 12:30</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:5">Kur 13:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyo byona ku byahweire, abatware bampika haihi, bangira bati: Abantu ba Israeli n'abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi tibeetaaniise n'abantu b'ensi ezi hamwe n'ebihagaro byabo, Abanyakanaani, Abahiiti, Abaperizi, Abayebusi, Abaamoni, Abamoabu, Abanyamisri n'Abaamori; <verse eid="EZR 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 10:2">Ezr 10:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:3">Bir 7:3</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 7:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 10:30">Neh 10:30</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:23">13:23</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 13:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:35">Zab 106:35</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:14">2 Kor 6:14</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba bashweire bamwe omuri bahara baabo, kandi baabashwererera n'abatabani baabo; n'ahabw'ekyo eihanga eririkwera ryejwangize n'abanyamahanga b'omuri ezi nsi. Kandi abategyeki n'abakuru nibo bakirize abandi kukora ekyo kicumuro. <verse eid="EZR 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3" />Ku naahuriire ebyo, naataagura ebijwaro n'omunagiro gwangye, naayemaanyura eishokye omu mutwe, kandi n'obureju, naashutama ahansi nshobeirwe munonga. <verse eid="EZR 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 10:3">Ezr 10:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:2">Isa 66:2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 66:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 29:39">Kur 29:39</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abantu boona, abu ebigambo bya Ruhanga wa Israeli byareeteire kutetema ahabw'ekicumuro ky'abaarugire omu bukwatwa, baateeranira ahu naabaire nshutami nshobeirwe, okuhitsya aha bunaku bw'okutamba ekitambo ky'omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="EZR 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:22">1 Bag 8:22</ref>. </char></note> Obunaku bw'ekitambo ky'omu mwabazyo ku bwahikire, naimuka ahu naabaire nyecureereize, ebijwaro byangye n'omunagiro gwangye bitaagukire, naatsimba amaju, naateega MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye emikono, <verse eid="EZR 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:9">2 Bus 28:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 38:4">Zab 38:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:5">Kush 18:5</ref>. </char></note> ningira nti:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 9:6">Ai Ruhanga wangye, nyine enshoni z'okwimutsya amaisho kukureeba, nimbwerabwera omu maisho gaawe, Ruhanga wangye; ahabw'okuba ebibi byaitu bikanyire, byatukira aha mutwe, n'orubanja rwaitu rwatuuma, rwahika omu iguru. <verse eid="EZR 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:6">Zab 106:6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:5-8">Dan 9:5-8</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga omu biro bya baatatenkuriitwe tutuura twine orubanja ruhango n'okuhitsya hati; kandi ebicumuro byaitu nibyo byatureeteire hamwe n'abagabe baitu n'abanyamurwa baitu kuheebwayo omu mikono y'abagabe b'ezi nsi, okwitwa rurara, okutwarwa omu bukwatwa, okunyagwa n'okuhemuka, nk'oku kiri na hati. <verse eid="EZR 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 13:3">Zab 13:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10:20">Isa 10:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 22:23">22:23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:32">37:32</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omu biro ebi ebikye MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu ayorekire embabazi ze, yaagira abu yaatutsigiraho, yaatuha omwanya guhamire omu Mwanya gwe ogurikwera, ngu abone kushemuura amaisho gaitu, n'okutugaruramu otugara omu buhuuku bwaitu; <verse eid="EZR 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:28">Ezr 7:28</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:36">Neh 9:36</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba kwo turi abahuuku; kwonka Ruhanga tatutsigireho mubuhuuku bwaitu, kureka atworekire embabazi ze omu maisho g'abagabe b'Abaperisi; yaatugaruramu otugara, ngu tubone agombeka enju ya Ruhanga waitu, okuhunduuza ahasiisikaire, n'okutubeera orugo rw'okuturinda omuri Yuda na Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="EZR 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10" />Mbwenu, ai Ruhanga waitu, ka waatutambiire oti, ekindi nitwenda kugamba ki? Ahabw'okuba tukareka kworobera ebiragiro byawe, <verse eid="EZR 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:24-30">Lev 18:24-30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:1">Bir 7:1</ref>. </char></note> ebi waaragiire nooraba omu bairu baawe baanabi, noogira oti: Ensi ei murikuzamu kukubuura n'ensi esiisikaire ahabw'ebihagaro by'abantu baamwo, n'ebirikunugwa byabo ebigiijwize, okutashemera kukashaagaana. <verse eid="EZR 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:6">Bir 23:6</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mutarihingira bahara baanyu batabani baabo, nari kushwererera batabani baanyu bahara baabo, n'obu kwakuba okubendeza obusingye nari okuba gye, mubone kuba ab'amaani, n'okurya ebirungi by'ensi, kandi n'okugitsigira abaana baanyu, ekaba obuhunguzi bwabo obw'ebiro byona. <verse eid="EZR 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 11:6">Yob 11:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:10">Zab 103:10</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu nk'oku ebi byona byatubaireho ahabw'ebibi ebi twakozire, n'ahabw'orubanja rwaitu ruhango, haza iwe, Ruhanga waitu, okatuha ekifubiro ekitakuuraine na bibi byaitu, kandi okatutsigiraho ekicweka kirikwingana kiti, <verse eid="EZR 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:8">Bir 9:8</ref>. </char></note> mbwenu tugarukye tushiishe ebiragiro byawe, tushwererane n'amahanga agarikukora ebirikunugwa biti? Torikwija kutugirira ekiniga, okatumaraho, hakabura owaahonokaho, nari owaakira? <verse eid="EZR 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:33">Neh 9:33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:137">Zab 119:137</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 130:3">130:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:1">Yer 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:14">Dan 9:14</ref>. </char></note> Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, ori ow'amazima, ahabw'okuba tutsigaireho turi ekicweka ekyahonokireho, nk'oku kiri hati. Mbwenu reeba, turi aha omu maisho gaawe, tusingirwe orubanja; kandi tihaine orikubaasa kwemerera omu maisho gaawe ahabw'ekyo.<verse eid="EZR 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10" />
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okweteisa eby'okushwera abanyamahangakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 9:18">Bir 9:18</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:9">2 Bus 20:9</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 1:4-6">Neh 1:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:20">Dan 9:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ezera ku yaabaire naashaba, naayatura ebibi, naarira naayetuura ahansi omu maisho g'enju ya Ruhanga, omutwe muhango munonga gw'abashaija n'abakazi n'abaana gwaruga omuri Israeli, gwateeranira ah'ari; kandi abo bantu nabo baarira munonga. <verse eid="EZR 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:2">Ezr 9:2</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Shekania mwene Yehieli, ow'omuri beene Elamu, yaagambira Ezera ati: Tucumwire ahari Ruhanga waitu, twashwera abakazi b'abanyamahanga, kwonka n'obu kiraabe kiri kityo, na hati tukiine amatsiko ahabwa Israeli. <verse eid="EZR 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:4">Ezr 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 10:44">10:44</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 2:16">Mal 2:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:2">Bir 7:2</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 7:3">3</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ka turagaane na Ruhanga waitu, tushende abakazi abo boona n'abaana baabo, nk'obwengye bwa mukama wangye n'obw'abarikutetema ahabw'ekiragiro kya Ruhanga waitu, oku buri; kandi ka kikorwe, nk'oku ebiragiro birikuragiira. <verse eid="EZR 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4" />Imuka ahakuba n'omurimo gwawe, kandi naitwe tukwataniise naiwe; ba ow'amaani, okikore. <verse eid="EZR 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 5:12">Neh 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:25">13:25</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho Ezera yaimuka, yaarahiza abakuru b'omu banyamurwa, n'Abaleevi, n'Abaisraeli boona, ku bakora nk'oku kigambirwe. Batyo baarahira.<verse eid="EZR 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 9:18">Bir 9:18</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 3:1">Neh 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 12:22">12:22</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 12:23">23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Ezera yaaruga ahu yaabaire ari omu maisho g'enju ya Ruhanga, yaataaha omu kishengye kya Yehohanani mwene Eliashibu, yaaraaramu atariire n'obu kwakuba okunywa amaizi; ahakuba akaba naasaasibwa okucumura kw'abaarugire omu bukwatwa. <verse eid="EZR 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7" />Bwanyima baaranga omuri Yuda yoona na Yerusaalemu, ngu abantu boona abaarugire omu bukwatwa bateeranire Yerusaalemu; <verse eid="EZR 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8" />kandi ngu omuntu weena ku araabe atahikireyo omu biro bishatu, ebintu bye byona binyagwe, kandi nawe acuubwe omu mutwe gw'abaarugire omu bukwatwa, nk'oku abategyeki n'abakuru baaragiire.<verse eid="EZR 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9" />Bwanyima abashaija ba Yuda na Benyamiini boona baateeranira Yerusaalemu, ebyo biro bishatu bitakahweire; obwo kukaba kuri okwezi kwa mwenda, aha kiro kyakwo kya makumi abiri. Abantu boona baashutama omu kibuga ky'omu maisho g'enju ya Ruhanga, nibatetema ahabw'ekyo kigambo, n'ahabw'enjura nyingi. <verse eid="EZR 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10" />Ezera omunyamurwa yaayemerera, yaabagira ati: Mukacumura, mwashwera abakazi b'abanyamahanga, mwayongyerera Israeli orubanja. <verse eid="EZR 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:19">Yos 7:19</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo hati mwaturire MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baashwenkuriimwe ekibi kyanyu, mukore eki arikwenda; mwetaanise n'abantu b'omuri egi nsi kandi n'abanyamahangakazi. <verse eid="EZR 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12" />Ahonaaho abantu boona abaabaire bateeraniireyo baagarukamu n'eiraka rihango bati: Nikwo kiri; tushemereire kukora, nk'oku waagamba. <verse eid="EZR 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13" />Kwonka abantu ni baingi; kandi n'obunaku bw'enjura nyingi; titurikubaasa kwemerera aheeru. Kandi omurimo ogu ti gw'ekiro kimwe nari bibiri; ahakuba tukacumura munonga omu kigambo eki. <verse eid="EZR 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:4">Kub 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 30:8">2 Bus 30:8</ref>. </char></note> Abakuru baitu ka beemerere omu iziina ry'eihanga ryona; bwanyima ab'omu ndembo zaitu boona, abaashweire abanyamahangakazi, baije omu bunaku obu bateereirweho, hamwe n'abakuru n'abaramuzi aba buri rurembo, okuhitsya obu ekiniga kya Ruhanga waitu ekingi, eki atugiriire ahabw'ekigambo eki, kiraaturugyeho. <verse eid="EZR 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15" />Kwonka Yonasaani mwene Asaheeli na Yahazeya mwene Tikuva baayanga egyo naama, kandi Meshulaamu na Shabesai Omuleevi baikirizana nabo.<verse eid="EZR 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16" />Batyo abaarugire omu bukwatwa baaba nikwo baatwaza. Ezera omunyamurwa yaatoorana abashaija, abakuru b'amaju ga baishenkurubo, nk'oku ago maju gaabaire gari, kuba abajwekyerwa nk'oku amaziina gaabo gaabaire gari. Aha kiro ky'okubanza ky'okwezi kwa ikumi baashutama kwetegyereza ebyo bigambo, <verse eid="EZR 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17" />kandi aha kiro ky'okubanza eky'okwezi kw'okubanza baashangwa baaherize ebigambo by'abashaija boona abaabaire bashweire abanyamahangakazi.<verse eid="EZR 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 3:2">Ezr 3:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuri batabani b'abanyamurwa abaashweire abanyamahangakazi baashangamu Maaseya, Eliezeeri, Yaribu, na Gedalia, ab'omuri beene Yeshua mwene Yozadaaki na beene ishe. <verse eid="EZR 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:6">Lev 6:6</ref>. </char></note> Baarahira kushenda abakazi baabo, kandi empongano yaabo y'okwihaho ekibi ekaba eri empaya y'entaama ey'omu busyo ahabw'orubanja rwabo. <verse eid="EZR 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:3-42">Ezr 2:3-42</ref>. </char></note> Omuri beene Imeri: Hanani na Zebadia. <verse eid="EZR 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21" />Omuri beene Harimu: Maaseya, Eliya, Shemaaya, Yehieli na Uziya. <verse eid="EZR 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22" />Omuri beene Pashihuuri: Elioenai, Maaseya, Ishimaeli, Netaneeli. Yozabaadi, na Elasa.<verse eid="EZR 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23" />Omu Baleevi: Yozabaadi, Shimei, Kelaya (niwe Keliita), Pesahia, Yuda, na Eliezeeri. <verse eid="EZR 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24" />Omu beeshongozi, Eliashibu. Omu bakumiirizi, Shalumu, Telemu, na Uuri.<verse eid="EZR 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25" />Ab'omuri Israeli: omuri beene Paroshi, Ramia, Izia, Malukiya, Miyamiini, Eleazaari, Hashabia na Benaaya. <verse eid="EZR 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26" />Omuri beene Elamu: Matania, Zekaria, Yehieli, Abudi, Yeremoosi na Eliya. <verse eid="EZR 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27" />Omuri beene Zaatu: Elio-enai, Eliashibu Matania, Yeremoosi, Zabadi na Aziza. <verse eid="EZR 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28" />Omuri beene Bebai: Yehohanani, Hanania, Zabai, na Asulai. <verse eid="EZR 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29" />Omuri beene Baani; Meshulaamu, Maluki, Adaya, Yashubu, Sheali na Yeremoosi. <verse eid="EZR 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30" />Omuri beene Pehasi-moabu: Aduna, Kelali, Benaaya, Maaseya, Matania, Bezaleeli, Binui, na Manaase. <verse eid="EZR 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31" />Omuri beene Harimu: Eliezeeri, Ishiya, Malukiya, Shemaaya, Shimeoni, <verse eid="EZR 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32" />Benyamiini, Maluki, na Shemaria. <verse eid="EZR 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33" />Omuri beene Hashumu: Metanai, Matasa, Zabadi, Elifeleti, Yeremai, Manaase, na Shimei. <verse eid="EZR 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34" />Omuri beene Baani: Maadai, Amuraamu, Ueli, <verse eid="EZR 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35" />Benaaya, Bedeya, Keluhi, <verse eid="EZR 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36" />Vania, Meremoosi, Eliashibu, <verse eid="EZR 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37" />Matania, Matenai, na Yaasu. <verse eid="EZR 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38" />Omuri beene Binui: Shimei, <verse eid="EZR 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39" />Shelemia, Nasani, Adaaya, <verse eid="EZR 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40" />Makundebai, Shashai, Sharai, <verse eid="EZR 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41" />Azareeli, Shelemia, Shemaria, <verse eid="EZR 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42" />Shalumu, Amaria na Yosefu. <verse eid="EZR 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43" />Omuri beene Neebo; Yeyeli, Matitia, Zabadi, Zebina, Yadai Yoeli na Benaaya. <verse eid="EZR 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 10:3">Ezr 10:3</ref>. </char></note> Abo boona bakaba bashweire abanyamahangakazi, baababinga n'abaana baabo.<verse eid="EZR 10:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10" />
</usx>